WEBVTT

00:00.407 --> 00:04.987
<b>So these are the Accursed Lands and the 
Cursed Sea of Trees that bars all life?</b>

00:05.427 --> 00:06.287
<b>Let's go.</b>

00:06.287 --> 00:07.067
<b>Yes.</b>

00:11.337 --> 00:12.887
<b>A young girl?</b>

00:12.887 --> 00:14.867
<b>Stop right there, girl!</b>

00:14.867 --> 00:16.377
<b>Who are you?!</b>

00:17.847 --> 00:21.127
<b>I'm a Dark Elf who fled into 
these woods to survive.</b>

00:21.677 --> 00:23.817
<b>Our business is with this forest.</b>

00:23.817 --> 00:25.617
<b>You won't mind us entering, will you?</b>

00:25.617 --> 00:26.637
<b>You mustn't do that.</b>

00:26.637 --> 00:28.467
<b>I ask that you please refrain.</b>

00:32.917 --> 00:33.807
<b>We're leaving.</b>

00:35.337 --> 00:36.657
<b>What do you think you're doing?!</b>

00:36.657 --> 00:38.687
<b>She said they just want to live in peace.</b>

00:39.007 --> 00:40.847
<b>So there's no problem here.</b>

00:41.727 --> 00:42.917
<b>There's no problem here.</b>

00:42.917 --> 00:44.857
<b>That's the result of our investigation.</b>

00:46.247 --> 00:49.027
<b>Henceforth, I shall be taking command!</b>

00:50.457 --> 00:53.347
<b>We will now enter the Accursed Lands 
and conduct our investigation!</b>

00:53.347 --> 00:55.447
<b>To ascertain the truth of this calamity!</b>

00:56.087 --> 00:57.207
<b>As you say, boss.</b>

00:57.617 --> 00:58.667
<b>Stop it! Bargo!</b>

01:03.387 --> 01:05.007
<b>I guess it failed.</b>

01:06.827 --> 01:08.427
<b>What happened?</b>

01:08.427 --> 01:09.537
<b>It's a Witch!</b>

01:09.537 --> 01:10.757
<b>We found a damn Witch!</b>

01:11.867 --> 01:15.307
<b>And here everything was going so well, too.</b>

01:16.527 --> 01:20.007
<b>Life doesn't always go your way, does it?</b>

01:25.567 --> 01:27.287
<b>It really doesn't.</b>

03:02.537 --> 03:04.037
I'm the Monster You've Been Looking For

03:06.197 --> 03:07.047
<b>Bargo!</b>

03:07.467 --> 03:09.717
<b>I don't care who does it, just get 
a runner back home!</b>

03:10.097 --> 03:11.797
<b>They have to know about this!</b>

03:11.797 --> 03:14.097
<b>Sorry, buddy.</b>

03:14.097 --> 03:16.777
<b>She just took out our 
messengers with that attack.</b>

03:18.187 --> 03:21.477
<b>Come on. I'm the monster 
you've been looking for.</b>

03:21.777 --> 03:25.187
<b>The calamity you were searching 
for has appeared before you.</b>

03:27.857 --> 03:29.237
<b>Sir Verdel!</b>

03:29.527 --> 03:31.277
<b>Don't lose your nerve now!</b>

03:31.277 --> 03:33.157
<b>We have no choice but to fight at this point!</b>

03:33.647 --> 03:35.407
<b>Everyone, combat formation!</b>

03:36.777 --> 03:38.087
<b>Ready your weapons!</b>

03:38.087 --> 03:40.297
<b>We will now eliminate the calamity!</b>

03:40.297 --> 03:41.387
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:41.387 --> 03:43.957
<b>Oh? You're attacking me?</b>

03:48.607 --> 03:49.667
<b>Fire!</b>

03:54.757 --> 03:56.397
<b>No mercy!</b>

03:56.397 --> 03:57.967
<b>That's good!</b>

03:57.967 --> 03:59.567
<b>I like this!</b>

03:59.567 --> 04:01.227
<b>Love it, in fact!</b>

04:01.587 --> 04:02.687
<b>Impossible!</b>

04:02.687 --> 04:04.407
<b>Dammit!</b>

04:04.407 --> 04:05.757
<b>This is horrible!</b>

04:05.757 --> 04:07.687
<b>And everything nearly went so well!</b>

04:07.687 --> 04:10.167
<b>I'm completely in agreement.</b>

04:10.167 --> 04:13.397
<b>I also regret that it's come to this.</b>

04:15.367 --> 04:19.987
<b>Though it's all the fault of that fool</b>

04:19.987 --> 04:22.497
<b>who brandished his silly piety</b>

04:22.497 --> 04:25.827
<b>and tried to pry where he shouldn't.</b>

04:25.827 --> 04:29.797
<b>Sir Verdel, what... exactly is a Witch?</b>

04:30.087 --> 04:33.647
<b>I was ordered to keep it strictly
confidential by the higher-ups,</b>

04:33.647 --> 04:35.257
<b>but I guess I should have told you.</b>

04:35.937 --> 04:39.657
<b>When the saint receives a revelation 
and the upper ranks confirm it,</b>

04:39.657 --> 04:43.347
<b>that monster is designated as 
a calamity and called a Witch.</b>

04:43.347 --> 04:45.807
<b>The commotion up north was 
caused by a Witch too!</b>

04:49.527 --> 04:52.317
<b>This woman is likely that very same thing!</b>

04:52.317 --> 04:55.067
<b>Do you understand how dangerous 
the situation we're in is now?!</b>

04:55.387 --> 04:56.067
<b>Yes!</b>

04:56.067 --> 04:57.577
<b>All done?</b>

04:58.307 --> 05:01.867
<b>All finished chatting?</b>

05:01.867 --> 05:03.777
<b>Mercenaries, fall back!</b>

05:03.777 --> 05:05.457
<b>We'll face her!</b>

05:05.457 --> 05:07.417
<b>Follow my lead, Lonius!</b>

05:07.417 --> 05:11.837
<b>O God! Grant me the power 
to strike down evil!</b>

05:18.087 --> 05:20.757
<b>So slow. Weak, too.</b>

05:20.757 --> 05:24.227
<b>Nah, that ain't necessarily the case!</b>

05:30.907 --> 05:33.067
<b>First, we'll deal with those 
disgusting tentacles!</b>

05:33.457 --> 05:34.917
<b>We're cutting them all off!</b>

05:34.917 --> 05:35.897
<b>Yes!</b>

05:37.467 --> 05:40.607
<b>Using a god's blessing to 
deliver a divine strike?</b>

05:40.607 --> 05:45.247
<b>The effect is a special attack bonus 
against evil-aligned entities, I'd say.</b>

05:45.247 --> 05:48.367
<b>This is the problem with units 
from a good civilization.</b>

05:50.997 --> 05:52.587
<b>Just three more!</b>

05:52.587 --> 05:54.087
<b>Why, you!</b>

05:59.517 --> 06:01.007
<b>Well done!</b>

06:01.337 --> 06:02.237
<b>What?!</b>

06:02.237 --> 06:02.847
<b>Shit!</b>

06:05.897 --> 06:06.797
<b>Dammit!</b>

06:07.287 --> 06:08.347
<b>Sir Verdel!</b>

06:08.347 --> 06:09.537
<b>Pardon me.</b>

06:09.537 --> 06:12.627
<b>I was taking you Paladins a bit too lightly.</b>

06:12.627 --> 06:15.447
<b>You've proven stronger than expected.</b>

06:15.447 --> 06:18.247
<b>However, how is this for you?</b>

06:18.247 --> 06:20.007
<b>Can you strike now?</b>

06:20.007 --> 06:21.577
<b>You can't, can you?</b>

06:21.577 --> 06:23.907
<b>This is why I love humans.</b>

06:23.907 --> 06:27.987
<b>You care for each other so much
that you make perfect shields!</b>

06:27.987 --> 06:29.867
<b>S-Save me!</b>

06:29.867 --> 06:31.577
<b>You fiend!</b>

06:31.577 --> 06:33.087
<b>Restrain yourself, Lonius!</b>

06:33.657 --> 06:35.027
<b>Just two more.</b>

06:35.027 --> 06:38.047
<b>Cut off two more, and we win.</b>

06:39.047 --> 06:40.757
<b>But then—</b>

06:41.127 --> 06:44.327
<b>If we defeat that fiend, then 
we'll purge the calamity.</b>

06:44.327 --> 06:46.687
<b>There won't be any harm to our homeland.</b>

06:47.217 --> 06:49.267
<b>Think of the bigger picture right now!</b>

06:49.267 --> 06:50.497
<b>I understand.</b>

06:52.597 --> 06:54.307
<b>What?! Why are you attacking?!</b>

06:56.567 --> 06:58.027
<b>The hostages too?!</b>

06:58.027 --> 07:00.037
<b><i>I'm sorry, but—</i></b>

07:00.037 --> 07:00.857
<b><i>This is—</i></b>

07:12.407 --> 07:13.037
<b>Huh?</b>

07:15.227 --> 07:16.497
<b>Run!</b>

07:17.257 --> 07:19.127
<b>Run, Loni—!</b>

07:24.867 --> 07:26.727
<b>S-Sir Verdel?!</b>

07:33.827 --> 07:34.597
<b>How?</b>

07:35.317 --> 07:37.107
<b>We cut all the tentacles!</b>

07:37.347 --> 07:40.067
<b>Did I ever say I only had six?</b>

07:40.337 --> 07:43.417
<b>I can replace these as much as I want.</b>

07:43.417 --> 07:44.187
<b>Wha?!</b>

07:45.287 --> 07:48.067
<b><i>She was toying with us
from the very start?</i></b>

07:51.367 --> 07:52.577
<b>Now then...</b>

07:55.557 --> 07:56.277
<b>Run!</b>

07:56.277 --> 07:57.037
<b>Huh?</b>

07:57.037 --> 07:59.867
<b>Have everyone scatter and 
run in different directions!</b>

07:59.867 --> 08:03.677
<b>At least one person must survive 
to warn our homeland about this!</b>

08:08.127 --> 08:09.717
<b>You just had to do that.</b>

08:14.477 --> 08:15.937
<b>How are you...</b>

08:15.937 --> 08:19.187
<b>Able to use Holy Sword Artes, you ask?</b>

08:23.277 --> 08:25.027
<b>I stole them.</b>

08:25.027 --> 08:26.987
<b>From that man there.</b>

08:27.497 --> 08:28.727
<b>Stole them?</b>

08:28.727 --> 08:29.447
<b>Yes.</b>

08:29.447 --> 08:31.987
<b>All the diligent effort he put in,</b>

08:31.987 --> 08:34.087
<b>all the techniques he honed,</b>

08:34.087 --> 08:35.957
<b>became mine the moment I killed him!</b>

08:39.007 --> 08:40.667
<b>The skill behind this technique!</b>

08:41.207 --> 08:43.297
<b>It seems Paladin Verdel</b>

08:43.297 --> 08:47.337
<b>was a man worthy of being 
called a powerful fighter.</b>

08:47.337 --> 08:49.927
<b>Though he died from your shortsightedness!</b>

08:50.587 --> 08:53.647
<b>So your wife's name is Marsha, 
and Mina's your daughter?</b>

08:55.367 --> 08:58.217
<b>How do you know that?! Did you also...</b>

08:58.217 --> 09:00.007
<b>Yes, I stole it!</b>

09:00.007 --> 09:02.787
<b>His feelings, his memories, everything!</b>

09:02.787 --> 09:04.607
<b>I-Impossible!</b>

09:05.147 --> 09:07.127
<b><i>Skills, memories...</i></b>

09:07.127 --> 09:09.457
<b><i>She steals everything from those she kills?</i></b>

09:10.057 --> 09:14.077
<b><i>So that means she only gets 
stronger the more she kills?!</i></b>

09:14.407 --> 09:19.787
<b>"If I die here, what will happen 
to Lonius and his family?"</b>

09:20.147 --> 09:24.977
<b>"The mercenaries, and even myself, all 
have people waiting for our return!"</b>

09:26.007 --> 09:27.707
<b>How heroic.</b>

09:27.707 --> 09:29.867
<b>No wonder he was a High Paladin.</b>

09:29.867 --> 09:34.057
<b>He was concerned for all of your 
safety until his final moment.</b>

09:34.057 --> 09:39.327
<b>So what are you feeling after 
hearing that, Paladin Lonius?!</b>

09:42.487 --> 09:45.437
<b>H-His will still lives on!</b>

09:45.437 --> 09:48.297
<b>While I'm keeping you in check here,</b>

09:48.297 --> 09:50.127
<b>the mercenaries can escape!</b>

09:52.367 --> 09:53.617
<b>What?!</b>

09:53.617 --> 09:56.577
<b>Oh, that's the Dark Elves.</b>

09:56.577 --> 09:59.847
<b>I ordered them to not let a single man escape.</b>

10:00.417 --> 10:01.727
<b>Huh?</b>

10:01.727 --> 10:05.627
<b>Did I ever say that I was alone?</b>

10:17.287 --> 10:20.057
<b>Why don't we talk about a 
future that could have been?</b>

10:20.797 --> 10:25.947
<b>This is what would have happened if 
you had listened to Paladin Verdel:</b>

10:27.067 --> 10:29.097
<b>You would have returned home safely</b>

10:29.097 --> 10:31.367
<b>and been reunited with your beloved family.</b>

10:31.367 --> 10:34.697
<b>You would have enjoyed the peaceful 
happiness of an ordinary life,</b>

10:35.177 --> 10:38.707
<b>and continued offering your 
prayers of gratitude to your god.</b>

10:38.707 --> 10:42.577
<b>Meanwhile, we would have been 
blessed with peace as well.</b>

10:42.897 --> 10:44.807
<b>The forest would have remained tranquil,</b>

10:44.807 --> 10:49.577
<b>and I would have gone to bed 
hoping that could last forever.</b>

10:51.267 --> 10:54.547
<b>Now, let's talk about the 
future you have chosen.</b>

10:54.877 --> 10:56.407
<b>You will die.</b>

10:56.407 --> 10:59.467
<b>Then your family will die too.</b>

10:59.467 --> 11:02.297
<b>I'll hunt them down and kill them.</b>

11:03.227 --> 11:05.627
<b>I'll torment them, and torment them,</b>

11:05.627 --> 11:09.607
<b>and torment them, until they plead 
for death. Only then will I kill them.</b>

11:09.987 --> 11:14.527
<b>After that, I'll go to every village and 
town you all stopped at on your way here,</b>

11:14.527 --> 11:16.887
<b>and I'll kill everyone living there.</b>

11:16.887 --> 11:19.037
<b>There won't be much point or meaning to that,</b>

11:19.037 --> 11:21.207
<b>but I might as well kill them.</b>

11:21.597 --> 11:23.747
<b>When they ask me why,</b>

11:23.747 --> 11:27.527
<b>I'll tell them it was because 
of your foolish actions,</b>

11:27.527 --> 11:28.707
<b>then I'll kill them.</b>

11:29.037 --> 11:30.187
<b>Stop!</b>

11:30.887 --> 11:33.707
<b>When people disregard you, you're finished.</b>

11:33.707 --> 11:36.517
<b>So be sure to kill them when they do.</b>

11:36.517 --> 11:39.097
<b>That's what I was taught 
by someone precious to me.</b>

11:39.577 --> 11:41.467
<b>So I'm killing them.</b>

11:41.467 --> 11:43.227
<b>I'll kill them without exception,</b>

11:43.227 --> 11:45.737
<b>to make sure none ever look down on me,</b>

11:45.737 --> 11:53.107
<b>no matter how many hundreds, thousands, 
or millions that number has to climb to.</b>

11:53.107 --> 11:56.327
<b>This is what you have chosen.</b>

11:57.527 --> 11:59.107
<b>S-Stop!</b>

11:59.657 --> 12:02.037
<b>Stop it, please!</b>

12:02.277 --> 12:05.267
<b>I'm sure you were a good person!</b>

12:05.267 --> 12:06.467
<b>You believed in your god,</b>

12:06.467 --> 12:07.747
<b>devoted yourself to your nation,</b>

12:07.747 --> 12:09.697
<b>and loved your family!</b>

12:09.697 --> 12:11.257
<b>How commendable!</b>

12:11.567 --> 12:16.257
<b>But this is why I hate those 
who believe they are just.</b>

12:19.477 --> 12:22.597
<b>Farewell, Paladin Lonius.</b>

12:24.017 --> 12:27.817
<b>Please watch from your VIP seat in heaven.</b>

12:27.817 --> 12:35.447
<b>Watch as those dear to you and all those 
innocent bystanders suffer atrocious deaths.</b>

13:04.717 --> 13:05.697
<b>Lady Atou.</b>

13:06.807 --> 13:08.097
<b>Yes, Gia?</b>

13:08.407 --> 13:11.297
<b>We finished off everyone as you ordered.</b>

13:11.297 --> 13:15.567
<b>I'm sure our king will be 
delighted to hear that as well.</b>

13:15.567 --> 13:18.107
<b>I'm heading back, then.</b>

13:18.107 --> 13:20.827
<b>You're in charge of disposing of the corpses.</b>

13:21.067 --> 13:21.957
<b>Umm...</b>

13:23.937 --> 13:25.117
<b>What is it?</b>

13:25.117 --> 13:29.577
<b>Are you actually going to carry 
out what you just said to him?</b>

13:29.577 --> 13:30.497
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:32.917 --> 13:34.397
<b>Oh, come on!</b>

13:34.397 --> 13:36.597
<b>There's no way I'm doing all that!</b>

13:36.597 --> 13:37.257
<b>Huh?</b>

13:37.377 --> 13:39.627
<b>I'm a pacifist.</b>

13:39.627 --> 13:41.957
<b>I was just messing around!</b>

13:41.957 --> 13:43.347
<b>Just messing with him!</b>

13:42.557 --> 13:44.717
<b>Pacifist?</b>

13:44.717 --> 13:45.977
<b>Oh, shoot!</b>

13:45.977 --> 13:48.297
<b>I don't have time to waste here.</b>

13:48.297 --> 13:50.557
<b>I need to hurry back to our king!</b>

13:51.487 --> 13:53.187
<b>Is there something concerning you?</b>

13:53.457 --> 13:54.357
<b>Yes.</b>

13:56.327 --> 13:59.837
<b>There's something I need 
to tell our king at once.</b>

14:12.827 --> 14:14.337
<b>Witches...</b>

14:14.647 --> 14:18.787
<b>There wasn't a unit like that 
in <i>Eternal Nations</i>, was there?</b>

14:18.787 --> 14:19.547
<b>There wasn't.</b>

14:19.987 --> 14:23.897
<b>It would seem this world definitely 
isn't the world of the game.</b>

14:23.897 --> 14:25.597
<b>I see.</b>

14:27.807 --> 14:30.677
<b>I thought that might be the case,</b>

14:31.207 --> 14:34.397
<b>but I guess we really have 
come to another world.</b>

14:34.777 --> 14:38.117
<b>The game's mechanics have 
been applicable to an extent,</b>

14:38.117 --> 14:43.017
<b>but we should operate under the assumption 
that the world functions differently.</b>

14:43.017 --> 14:44.987
<b>That's troublesome.</b>

14:44.987 --> 14:49.207
<b>However, there are also good aspects 
to it being different from the game.</b>

14:50.247 --> 14:52.647
<b>You're referring to your ability?</b>

14:52.647 --> 14:53.417
<b>Yes.</b>

14:55.027 --> 14:57.877
<b><i>The special ability Atou 
possessed in the game</i></b>

14:58.337 --> 15:00.827
<b><i>granted her a set chance</i></b>

15:00.827 --> 15:04.007
<b><i>to steal a defeated unit's ability.</i></b>

15:04.647 --> 15:05.967
<b><i>But...</i></b>

15:06.487 --> 15:10.347
<b>I'm able to steal my defeated opponents' 
memories to some degree as well.</b>

15:10.907 --> 15:14.087
<b>This will prove a great 
weapon in our arsenal.</b>

15:14.087 --> 15:17.197
<b>Right. Thanks to that, we've learned 
about the situation in Qualia</b>

15:17.197 --> 15:18.737
<b>without sending anyone to investigate.</b>

15:19.037 --> 15:20.167
<b>Yes.</b>

15:20.167 --> 15:23.447
<b>It's fortunate for us that Qualia 
doesn't have the forces to spare</b>

15:23.447 --> 15:26.327
<b>thanks to the disaster in the place 
they call the Northern Province.</b>

15:26.587 --> 15:29.877
<b>Good. We can take it easy for a while, then.</b>

15:31.177 --> 15:36.337
<b>I think they're likely to take some kind 
of action after we wiped them out, though.</b>

15:36.667 --> 15:40.627
<b>They don't have any information on us.</b>

15:40.627 --> 15:43.797
<b>So even if they do act, they'll 
have to do so with caution.</b>

15:44.097 --> 15:48.517
<b>What concerns me more is 
the cause of that disaster.</b>

15:48.847 --> 15:50.997
<b>The Northern Disturbance...</b>

15:50.997 --> 15:53.747
<b>It was caused by a Witch, right?</b>

15:53.747 --> 15:56.607
<b>Yes. According to the memories I stole.</b>

15:57.167 --> 15:58.727
<b>Do you know anything else?</b>

16:01.087 --> 16:03.177
<b>Unfortunately, not much.</b>

16:03.637 --> 16:07.077
<b>It seems even Qualia doesn't 
know much about the Witch.</b>

16:07.427 --> 16:08.867
<b>What they do know</b>

16:08.867 --> 16:13.157
<b>is that she's caused damage on par with 
armies to the cities of the Northern Province,</b>

16:13.517 --> 16:15.627
<b>and what she's called.</b>

16:16.587 --> 16:17.597
<b>Let me hear it.</b>

16:18.087 --> 16:22.227
<b>Apparently she's called 
"Erakino, the Slurping Witch."</b>

16:22.227 --> 16:30.847
<b>Click, clack, click, clack.</b>

16:31.557 --> 16:34.337
<b>Rattle, roll, rattle, roll.</b>

16:34.337 --> 16:37.127
<b>The gods never roll the dice.</b>

16:37.127 --> 16:39.577
<b>Dreams and hope are nowhere to be found.</b>

16:39.577 --> 16:43.127
<b>Life is all just killing time.</b>

16:43.127 --> 16:45.987
<b>All right then, we're off to the next city!</b>

16:45.987 --> 16:50.777
<b>All my simps, come on!</b>

17:00.527 --> 17:01.837
<b>Atou,</b>

17:01.837 --> 17:07.337
<b>that Northern Disturbance 
occurred recently, right?</b>

17:07.337 --> 17:08.297
<b>Yes.</b>

17:08.617 --> 17:10.477
<b>So a monster showed up</b>

17:10.477 --> 17:15.037
<b>that's capable of causing damage on 
par with armies in such a short time?</b>

17:16.887 --> 17:21.117
<b>Maybe it's possible they came 
to this world much like we did?</b>

17:23.557 --> 17:28.827
<b>Either way, it's clear that they have 
someone with the strength of Hero units.</b>

17:29.407 --> 17:32.157
<b>This is a troublesome turn of events.</b>

17:34.687 --> 17:36.407
<b>What shall we do about it?</b>

17:36.807 --> 17:40.877
<b>Judging by their actions, I believe 
they're also evil-aligned,</b>

17:41.217 --> 17:43.237
<b>but would you like to try 
reaching out to them?</b>

17:44.987 --> 17:47.447
<b>I don't think we should do that.</b>

17:47.447 --> 17:49.137
<b>We'll never get along anyway.</b>

17:49.137 --> 17:51.397
<b>Not when we're both evil.</b>

17:51.397 --> 17:52.967
<b>That's true.</b>

17:55.267 --> 17:58.267
<b>Everything was going so well, too.</b>

17:58.267 --> 18:01.607
<b>Why do we have to deal with 
one problem after another?</b>

18:01.607 --> 18:04.647
<b>Well, it's happening in the distant north.</b>

18:04.647 --> 18:07.977
<b>The fact that we have time to deal 
with it is a blessing, at least.</b>

18:07.977 --> 18:09.067
<b>Yes.</b>

18:09.847 --> 18:14.017
<b>Atou, now that we know they have 
combat strength equal to a Hero unit,</b>

18:14.017 --> 18:16.497
<b>there's one thing we have to do.</b>

18:17.057 --> 18:19.457
<b>Produce a new Hero, right?</b>

18:19.457 --> 18:21.067
<b>Exactly.</b>

18:21.067 --> 18:24.407
<b>I was planning on producing Isla,</b>

18:24.407 --> 18:27.167
<b>but maybe I should reconsider that now.</b>

18:27.167 --> 18:29.777
<b>Maybe it would be better to 
focus on combat potential.</b>

18:29.777 --> 18:31.297
<b>Good point.</b>

18:31.717 --> 18:36.807
<b>It'll still take a bit more time to gather 
the necessary mana to produce a Hero.</b>

18:36.807 --> 18:40.517
<b>I'll lend what little help 
I can too, King Takuto!</b>

18:40.517 --> 18:42.397
<b>Thanks, Atou.</b>

18:42.807 --> 18:46.647
<b>Though Isla's not the only 
thing I need to reconsider.</b>

18:46.647 --> 18:47.777
<b>Meaning?</b>

18:48.417 --> 18:51.277
<b>I'm thinking of altering 
our policies a little.</b>

18:51.827 --> 18:53.297
<b>Our policies?</b>

18:54.367 --> 18:56.567
<b>Let's forge an alliance.</b>

18:56.567 --> 18:57.817
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:59.127 --> 19:02.397
<b>We have a clear enemy in Qualia.</b>

19:02.397 --> 19:05.197
<b>Plus we have the uncertain 
element of the Witch.</b>

19:05.197 --> 19:07.587
<b>So I want to have another nation on our side.</b>

19:07.587 --> 19:09.497
<b>I understand your reasoning,</b>

19:09.497 --> 19:10.817
<b>but is that possible?</b>

19:10.817 --> 19:13.137
<b>We're evil-aligned, you know.</b>

19:13.137 --> 19:15.867
<b>It's possible if there's
value for the other nation.</b>

19:15.867 --> 19:19.257
<b>Of course, that will only work 
with a neutral-aligned nation.</b>

19:19.257 --> 19:21.647
<b>A neutral-aligned...</b>

19:21.647 --> 19:23.947
<b>You mean the nation to our east?</b>

19:23.947 --> 19:24.857
<b>Yeah!</b>

19:25.147 --> 19:26.987
<b>Once the Palace is complete,</b>

19:26.987 --> 19:31.577
<b>I want to investigate that nation 
while strengthening our forces.</b>

19:31.577 --> 19:34.867
<b>We need to find out if they're 
willing to join forces with us.</b>

19:47.007 --> 19:48.807
<b>That's a Staff Holder for you!</b>

19:48.807 --> 19:51.087
<b>She defeated so many barbarians so easily!</b>

19:51.087 --> 19:54.197
<b>Quit putting your elders on a pedestal!</b>

19:54.197 --> 19:57.177
<b>Hurry up and clear away the 
dead before you celebrate!</b>

19:57.457 --> 19:58.427
<b>Yes!</b>

20:01.137 --> 20:02.847
<b>W-What's that?!</b>

20:02.847 --> 20:03.427
<b>Umm...</b>

20:03.927 --> 20:04.847
<b>Wha?!</b>

20:09.057 --> 20:10.507
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

20:10.507 --> 20:13.197
<b>I've never seen numbers like that!</b>

20:13.197 --> 20:15.237
<b>Quit gawking at them!</b>

20:15.237 --> 20:16.827
<b>Ready your arms!</b>

20:16.827 --> 20:18.237
<b>Also, messengers!</b>

20:18.237 --> 20:19.717
<b>Go call for reinforcements!</b>

20:19.717 --> 20:20.627
<b>Yes!</b>

20:25.207 --> 20:28.357
<b>What is happening here?</b>

20:39.687 --> 20:43.347
<b>Umm, King Takuto?</b>

20:43.347 --> 20:45.307
<b>Hmm? What is it?</b>

20:47.257 --> 20:49.477
<b>Umm, well, see...</b>

20:50.277 --> 20:51.347
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:53.947 --> 21:01.697
<b>I figured I might have soured your mood.</b>

21:02.007 --> 21:02.917
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:03.407 --> 21:05.127
<b>W-Well, you know!</b>

21:05.127 --> 21:12.377
<b>Umm, I might have gone just a little 
too far against those Paladins...</b>

21:12.777 --> 21:14.007
<b>What about it?</b>

21:14.327 --> 21:15.257
<b>Huh?</b>

21:19.547 --> 21:20.327
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:26.377 --> 21:28.187
<b>It's all right.</b>

21:28.187 --> 21:32.147
<b>I would never be offended 
by anything you did, Atou.</b>

21:32.567 --> 21:36.127
<b>I really rely on you a lot, Atou,</b>

21:36.127 --> 21:37.857
<b>so please don't worry about that.</b>

21:38.427 --> 21:41.187
<b>Just continue supporting me.</b>

21:41.727 --> 21:43.867
<b>King Takuto!</b>

21:44.787 --> 21:46.387
<b>Of course!</b>

21:46.387 --> 21:51.287
<b>I'll support you with every 
fiber of my being, King Takuto!</b>

21:51.287 --> 21:54.237
<b>Now, give me any command you please!</b>

21:54.237 --> 21:55.377
<b>Go on!</b>

22:04.057 --> 22:10.057
Event Chain "Advent of the Apocalypse" has begun.
